msgstr "Obtén llave magnética del lab. 2.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_033"
msgid "Guard's\n"
msgstr "Guarda:\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_034"
msgid "Medlab 2 key card\n"
msgstr "Llave del lab. 2\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_035"
msgid "Medlab 2 key card\n"
msgstr "Llave magnética del lab. 2\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_036"
msgid "Picked up medlab 2 key card.\n"
msgstr "Llave magnética del lab. 2 obtenida.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_037"
msgid "Who are you?\n"
msgstr "¿Y tú quién eres?\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_038"
msgid "Hey - you've got my clothes.\n"
msgstr "Hey. Tienes mis ropas.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_039"
msgid "Help - help!\n"
msgstr "¡Socorro, socorro!\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_040"
msgid "Don't shoot me!\n"
msgstr "¡No me dispares!\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_041"
msgid "Oh, my God - a gun!\n"
msgstr "¡Oh, Dios mío, un arma!\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_042"
msgid "There's an intruder in the complex.\n"
msgstr "Hay un intruso en el complejo.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_043"
msgid "Give me back my clothes - or else!\n"
msgstr "Dame mis ropas... ¡o verás!\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_044"
msgid "Right - you've asked for it!\n"
msgstr "Vale. ¡Tú lo has querido!\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_045"
msgid "Give me my clothes.\n"
msgstr "Dame mis ropas.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_046"
msgid "I don't have much time!!!\n"
msgstr "¡¡¡No tengo mucho tiempo!!!\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_047"
msgid "The enemy has discovered the disguise.\n"
msgstr "El enemigo ha descubierto el disfraz.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_048"
msgid "Virus has already been downloaded.\n"
msgstr "El virus ya ha sido descargado.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_049"
msgid "Initiating virus download.\n"
msgstr "Iniciando descarga del virus.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_050"
msgid "So, you got here at last.\n"
msgstr "Así que por fin has llegado.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_051"
msgid "Hey, you're not... SECURITY ALERT!\n"
msgstr "Hey, tú no eres... ¡ALERTA, SEGURIDAD!\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_052"
msgid "No guns allowed in here - put your weapon away.\n"
msgstr "No se permiten armas aquí. Deja tu arma.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_053"
msgid "I won't tell you again - lose the weapon.\n"
msgstr "No te lo diré de nuevo. Tira tu arma.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_054"
msgid "Right - I'm calling security.\n"
msgstr "Vale. Estoy llamando a seguridad.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_055"
msgid "Everyone's been waiting for you...\n"
msgstr "Todos te están esperando...\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_056"
msgid "Critical mission personnel killed.\n"
msgstr "Ha muerto personal crítico de la misión.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_057"
msgid "Cannot gain access to autopsy lab.\n"
msgstr "No puedes acceder al laboratorio de autopsias.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_058"
msgid "Hey, that's not Harry. It's an intruder.\n"
msgstr "Hey, ése no es Harry. Es un intruso.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_059"
msgid "Obtain op room key card.\n"
msgstr "Obtén llave magnética del quirófano.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_060"
msgid "Guard's\n"
msgstr "Guarda:\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_061"
msgid "Op room key card\n"
msgstr "Llave del quirófano\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_062"
msgid "Op room key card\n"
msgstr "Llave magnética del quirófano\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_063"
msgid "Picked up operation room key card.\n"
msgstr "Llave magnética del quirófano obtenida.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_064"
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\n"
msgstr "Elvis ha muerto.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_065"
msgid "Get the hell out of here!\n"
msgstr "¡Salgamos de aquí!\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_066"
msgid "Containment unit raised up.\n"
msgstr "Contenedor subido.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_067"
msgid "Containment unit lowered down.\n"
msgstr "Contenedor bajado.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_068"
msgid "Mission critical equipment destroyed.\n"
msgstr "Equipo crítico de la misión destruido.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_069"
msgid "Obtain X-Ray Scanner.\n"
msgstr "Obtén Escáner de Rayos-X.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_070"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_071"
msgid "X-Ray Scanner\n"
msgstr "Escáner de Rayos-X\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_072"
msgid "X-Ray Scanner\n"
msgstr "Escáner de Rayos-X\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_073"
msgid "Picked up X-Ray Scanner.\n"
msgstr "Escáner de Rayos-X obtenido.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_074"
msgid "Scanner target acquired.\n"
msgstr "Sujeto de escaneo adquirido.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_075"
msgid "Target ID confirmed - XT origin.\n"
msgstr "ID. del sujeto confirmada - Origen E.T.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_076"
msgid "Scanner lock lost.\n"
msgstr "Conexión del escáner perdida.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_077"
msgid "Disguise has been worn.\n"
msgstr "El disfraz ha sido usado.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_078"
msgid ""
"The showers... Now, if I can convince someone \n"
"to part with their uniform...\n"
msgstr ""
"Las duchas... Ahora, si pudiera convencer a alguien \n"
"para irme con su uniforme...\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_079"
msgid ""
"The temperature's dropping... You must be \n"
"close to the cryo room.\n"
msgstr ""
"La temperatura está bajando... Debes de estar \n"
"cerca de la sala de criogenización.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_080"
msgid ""
"The air's heavily recycled around here - must\n"
" be near the autopsy lab.\n"
msgstr ""
"El aire está fuertemente reciclado aquí: debo\n"
" estar cerca del laboratorio de autopsias.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_081"
msgid "There he is, Jo! Hurry or you'll be too late!\n"
msgstr "¡Ahí está, Joanna! ¡Deprisa o será tarde!\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_082"
msgid "Leave this area now.\n"
msgstr "Salga de este área.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_083"
msgid "Should you be in here?\n"
msgstr "¿Debe estar dentro?\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_084"
msgid "Holy...\n"
msgstr "Por t...\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_085"
msgid "It's a spy!\n"
msgstr "¡Es una espía!\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_086"
msgid "Warn the others...\n"
msgstr "Avisa a los otros...\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_087"
msgid "Imposter!\n"
msgstr "¡Impostora!\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_088"
msgid "Lighting systems overloaded.\n"
msgstr "Sistemas de luz sobrecargados.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_089"
msgid "Alternative entrance to medlabs created.\n"
msgstr "Creada entrada alternativa a los laboratorios.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_090"
msgid ""
"The problem you have is that there is no \n"
"way to sneak into the research section. \n"
"The only way in available to you is a \n"
"weak section of wall I've marked in the \n"
"room beyond the stores. It can be destroyed \n"
"with explosives.\n"
msgstr ""
"El problema que tienes es que no hay ningún \n"
"modo de entrar en la sección de desarrollo. \n"
"El único camino disponible es una parte \n"
"débil del muro que he marcado en la \n"
"habitación tras los almacenes. Puede ser  \n"
"destruida con explosivos.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_091"
msgid ""
"Doesn't sound like a problem to me. Where \n"
"are these explosives?\n"
msgstr ""
"No me parece un problema. ¿Dónde\n"
"están esos explosivos?\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_092"
msgid "In that crate.\n"
msgstr "En esa caja.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_093"
msgid "Cute. Very cute.\n"
msgstr "Bien. Muy bien.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_094"
msgid ""
"By the way, the stores are crawling with \n"
"guards. It may go against your nature, but \n"
"try sneaking through rather than blasting \n"
"everything.\n"
msgstr ""
"Eso sí, los almacenes están repletos de \n"
"guardas. Puede ir contra tu naturaleza, \n"
"pero intenta evitarlos antes de hacer \n"
"saltar todo por los aires.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_095"
msgid "Certainly. Any other pearls of wisdom?\n"
msgstr "Ciertamente. ¿Alguna otra perla de sabiduría?\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_096"
msgid "That crate...\n"
msgstr "Esa caja...\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_097"
msgid "Yes?\n"
msgstr "¿Sí?\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_098"
msgid "It really doesn't like being shot.\n"
msgstr "No le gusta que le disparen.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_099"
msgid ""
"Great. Now, if I can just fight the urge \n"
"to report him to Base Security...\n"
msgstr ""
"Genial. Ahora, si sólo pudiera luchar contra \n"
"el impulso de informar de él a Seguridad...\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_100"
msgid ""
"Put your hands up and step away from the \n"
"alien.\n"
msgstr ""
"Levantad las manos y alejaos del\n"
"alienígena.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_101"
msgid ""
"What the hell do you think you're doing? \n"
"This is supposed to be a sealed room! \n"
"Don't you know anything about autopsy \n"
"procedures?\n"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué demonios te crees que estás haciendo? \n"
"¡Esto se supone que es una sala sellada! \n"
"¿No sabes nada acerca de los procedimientos \n"
"de autopsia?\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_102"
msgid ""
"Don't make me tell you again, Doctor. And \n"
"turn that laser off.\n"
msgstr ""
"No me haga repetírselo, doctor. Y \n"
"apague ese láser.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_103"
msgid ""
"Director Easton will hear about this, \n"
"young lady.\n"
msgstr ""
"El Director Easton se enterará de esto, \n"
"jovencita.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_104"
msgid ""
"Of course he's going to hear of it, you \n"
"moron. I've just got into his top secret \n"
"base, and now I'm stealing his alien.\n"
msgstr ""
"Por supuesto que va a enterarse, idiota. \n"
"He logrado entrar en su base ultra-secreta, \n"
"y ahora le estoy robando su alienígena.\n"

msgctxt "L_LIP_105"
msgid "Automatic Defenses Disabled.\n"
msgstr "Defensas Automáticas Desactivadas.\n"
